exports[`ngAdd > the existing tailwind app with the full preset > prints the described plan, then the summary 1`] = `
[
  "Preflight:",
  "  ok Angular ^21.2.0 (cngx needs 21.1+)",
  "  ok Project tailwind-app (existing app)",
  "  ok Git working tree clean (review the cngx changes with git diff afterwards)",
  "Planned (13):",
  "  + Add @angular/cdk@^21.2.0 - a peer of the selected @cngx packages",
  "  + Add @floating-ui/dom@^1.0.0 - positions popovers where CSS anchor positioning is missing",
  "  + Create src/cngx-layers.css - declares the Tailwind and cngx cascade layer order",
  "  + Order the Tailwind and cngx cascade layers - Tailwind preflight must not override cngx component styles; utilities still win",
  "  + Import @cngx/themes/cngx.css in src/styles.scss - cngx tokens, layers and directive styles",
  "  + Create src/cngx-theme.css - every system token, ready to override",
  "  + Add src/cngx-theme.css to the build styles - after src/styles.scss, so the cngx layer order is set first",
  "  + Provide the a11y preferences - density, text scale, motion and contrast stay inert without it",
  "  + Provide toasts, alerts and banners - CngxToaster, CngxAlerter and CngxBanner are not provided at the root",
  "  + Provide the floating positioning fallback - positions popovers where CSS anchor positioning is missing",
  "  + Place the toast and banner outlets in src/app/app.html - CngxToaster and CngxBanner render nowhere without them",
  "  + Import the toast and banner outlets in src/app/app.ts - CngxToaster and CngxBanner render nowhere without them",
  "  + Write .cngx/install.json for tailwind-app - records this install for a re-run and ng update",
  "Notes (3):",
  "  - Keep the declared @cngx versions - this is an unstamped local build (0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER), which pins no @cngx version; pack the libs with node scripts/pack-libs.mjs and install the tarballs; add @cngx/utils, @cngx/core, @cngx/common, @cngx/interop, @cngx/forms, @cngx/data-display, @cngx/ui and @cngx/themes that way",
  "  - Replace the Angular welcome app with the cngx starter in src/app - src/app/app.ts, its template or its stylesheet is not the untouched ng new scaffold, so the starter is not written over it",
  "  - Skip the eslint entry - no eslint flat config (eslint.config.js, .mjs, .cjs, .ts, .mts or .cts) found; set one up with \`ng add angular-eslint\`, then run \`ng add @cngx/core\` again",
  "Warnings (1):",
  "  ! No usable versions.json next to the schematics; pinning @cngx/mcp@0.2.0 and @cngx/eslint-plugin@0.2.0 (a local build).",
  "cngx applied 13 changes.",
  "Next steps:",
  "  Run \`npx @cngx/doctor\` to check the wiring.",
  "Docs:",
  "  cngx documentation: https://cngxjs.github.io/cngx/",
]
`;

